  "description": "OEDRO's Quad-Fold truck bed tonneau cover gives your truck the perfect combination of security, convenience, and appearance. It is easy to install and the tailgate lock turns your truck bed into a completely secure trunk that is snowproof and dust-proof.\nFeatures\nQuick clamp, worry-free installation. Simple clip-on guide rails and joints do not require drilling or other special tools. The tailgate system with a double T-screw latch allows easy adjustment and fixation of the cover.\nHeavy-duty crossbars. High-quality pre-assembled aluminum frames and crossbars are used to support the vinyl by applying horizontal tension, providing maximum safety and durability through easy installation and operation.\nDurable vinyl fabric. OEDRO's trunk lid is made of double-layer PVC, which has been thoroughly tested and has UV protection and good tensile properties.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with: 2002-2018 Dodge Ram 1500 | Fleetside 6.4ft Bed without Ram Box.\nCompatible with: 2019-2024 Dodge Ram 1500 Classic | Fleetside 6.4ft Bed without Ram Box.\nCompatible with: 2019-2026 Dodge Ram 1500 New Body | Fleetside 6.4ft Bed without Ram Box.\nCompatible with: 2003-2026 Dodge Ram 2500 3500| Fleetside 6.4ft Bed.",
